WEBVTT

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:02.298
Frankly, it's just not enough.

00:10:02.799 --> 00:10:05.201
Trans youth, like most young people,

00:10:05.235 --> 00:10:07.871
spend the majority
of their time in school.

00:10:08.738 --> 00:10:12.575
And if you spend Monday
through Friday, from 8 to 3,

00:10:12.609 --> 00:10:14.410
being told that you weren't OK,

00:10:14.444 --> 00:10:16.179
that you are wrong,

00:10:16.212 --> 00:10:18.414
how are you supposed to think otherwise?

00:10:18.948 --> 00:10:21.684
Home and community being accepting

00:10:21.684 --> 00:10:25.588
together create a space
where kids can accept themselves.

00:10:26.523 --> 00:10:28.091
I was able to do it

00:10:28.091 --> 00:10:30.293
because the fact that I was trans